{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "class FibonacciCalculator:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n-th Fibonacci number using memoization.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    def calculate(self, n: int) -> int:\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n        \n        result = self.calculate(n - 1) + self.calculate(n - 2)\n        self._memo[n] = result\n        return result\ndef fib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    >>> fib(10)\n    55\n    >>> fib(1)\n    1\n    >>> fib(8)\n    21\n    \"\"\"\n    calculator = FibonacciCalculator()\n    return calculator.calculate(n)"}
